    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/14280c6fdacdc3465a431301f85f61b2.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/dac92028b0e575371ba3ba559f3132c6.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Alderwick Valley! The mantle of Witch of the Valley now passes to you\u2014are you ready to embrace the magic your Aunt once wielded?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the Valley, you\u2019ll uncover a rich tapestry of strange and wonderful plants\u2014each with its own magical properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some plants thrive in the warmth of the sun, while others prefer the cool shade of the forest. Then there are the truly peculiar plants that are said to be touched by the ghosts that used to haunt the Valley, and others are filled with different flavored jelly that taste like candy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/6faf09510b732b813afb1d51415eefb3.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/5e8c3dbd010b0caf2dd01c8c4c1914a4.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mystical plants are more than just beautiful\u2014they\u2019re powerful. Use them to craft magical candles, each designed to solve a unique problem or unlock a hidden truth.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Need to inspire confidence? Try crafting the Lion's Breath candle!</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trying to mend a broken bridge or reveal a secret cave? There\u2019s a candle for that too.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/cb24385082e4a2ec99b1b3e5b9f50d71.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/40a1544b3c79bc69ffc45a39259d7d0b.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover what your candles can do to the Valley. Whether you're mending broken bridges, banishing the glowing Moss, or solving the Valley\u2019s many riddles, your candles are the key to it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/c309ee266e49a564e528dc119c972768.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure, mystery, and magic await\u2014are you ready to light the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/9348c65305c510666868674b351513d8.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Candle Crafting</strong> \u2013 Collect ingredients and craft magical candles with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>First-Person Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through a richly detailed, peaceful forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Cozy and Relaxing Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No combat, no pressure \u2014 just calm, creative play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Play as a Witch</strong> \u2013 Learn forgotten rituals, explore magical traditions, and grow your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Interactions</strong> \u2013 Use crafted candles to unlock secrets and shape your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Narrative Through Discovery</strong> \u2013 Uncover the story through exploration, not exposition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/14280c6fdacdc3465a431301f85f61b2.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/dac92028b0e575371ba3ba559f3132c6.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Alderwick Valley! The mantle of Witch of the Valley now passes to you\u2014are you ready to embrace the magic your Aunt once wielded?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the Valley, you\u2019ll uncover a rich tapestry of strange and wonderful plants\u2014each with its own magical properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some plants thrive in the warmth of the sun, while others prefer the cool shade of the forest. Then there are the truly peculiar plants that are said to be touched by the ghosts that used to haunt the Valley, and others are filled with different flavored jelly that taste like candy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/6faf09510b732b813afb1d51415eefb3.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/5e8c3dbd010b0caf2dd01c8c4c1914a4.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mystical plants are more than just beautiful\u2014they\u2019re powerful. Use them to craft magical candles, each designed to solve a unique problem or unlock a hidden truth.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Need to inspire confidence? Try crafting the Lion's Breath candle!</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trying to mend a broken bridge or reveal a secret cave? There\u2019s a candle for that too.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/cb24385082e4a2ec99b1b3e5b9f50d71.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/40a1544b3c79bc69ffc45a39259d7d0b.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover what your candles can do to the Valley. Whether you're mending broken bridges, banishing the glowing Moss, or solving the Valley\u2019s many riddles, your candles are the key to it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/c309ee266e49a564e528dc119c972768.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure, mystery, and magic await\u2014are you ready to light the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648650/extras/9348c65305c510666868674b351513d8.avif?t=1749725660\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Candle Crafting</strong> \u2013 Collect ingredients and craft magical candles with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>First-Person Exploration</strong> \u2013 Wander through a richly detailed, peaceful forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Cozy and Relaxing Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No combat, no pressure \u2014 just calm, creative play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Play as a Witch</strong> \u2013 Learn forgotten rituals, explore magical traditions, and grow your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Interactions</strong> \u2013 Use crafted candles to unlock secrets and shape your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Narrative Through Discovery</strong> \u2013 Uncover the story through exploration, not exposition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Witchlight invites you into the world of Alderwick Valley. Craft candles to aid villagers, harvest ingredients and discover what secrets the Valley holds. Witchlight invites you to slow down and find meaning in the little things\u2014because even the smallest light can change everything.",
